Hence the standard cotangent‑tangent co‑function identity gives  

\[
\cot\!\left(\frac{\pi}{72}\right)=\tan\!\left(\frac{\pi}{2}-\frac{\pi}{72}\right),
\]

which is exactly the statement of the theorem. No additional premises are needed, and the equality is mathematically valid.
