Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Ring.Finset
Name: Finset.sum_sq_le_sq_sum_of_nonneg
Description: For any finite set $s$ and any function $f$ from the index type of $s$ to a non-negative real numbers (or more generally, a linearly ordered semiring), the sum of squares of $f$ over $s$ is less than or equal to the square of the sum of $f$ over $s$. That is,
