Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.UnorderedInterval
Name: Set.Icc_subset_uIcc'
Description: For any elements $a$ and $b$ in a lattice $\alpha$, the closed interval $[b, a]$ is a subset of the closed interval $[a \sqcap b, a \sqcup b]$. In other words, every element $x$ satisfying $b \leq x \leq a$ also satisfies $a \sqcap b \leq x \leq a \sqcup b$.
Signature:  : Icc b a ⊆ [[a, b]]

