Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Basic
Name: Set.Icc_inter_Icc
Description: For any elements $a₁, b₁, a₂, b₂$ in a lattice $\alpha$, the intersection of the closed intervals $[a₁, b₁]$ and $[a₂, b₂]$ equals the closed interval $[a₁ \sqcup a₂, b₁ \sqcap b₂]$. In symbols:
$$ [a₁, b₁] \cap [a₂, b₂] = [a₁ \sqcup a₂, b₁ \sqcap b₂] $$
Signature:  : Icc a₁ b₁ ∩ Icc a₂ b₂ = Icc (a₁ ⊔ a₂) (b₁ ⊓ b₂)

