Signature:  : Icc b a ⊆ [[a, b]]

3. [THEOREM] Translation of Sum in Closed Interval: $a + b \in [c, d] \leftrightarrow a \in [c - b, d - b]$
Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Interval.Set.Group
