Signature:  : a + b ∈ Set.Icc c d ↔ a ∈ Set.Icc (c - b) (d - b)

4. [THEOREM] Intersection of Closed Intervals in a Lattice: $[a₁, b₁] \cap [a₂, b₂] = [a₁ \sqcup a₂, b₁ \sqcap b₂]$
Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Basic
