1. [THEOREM] Rational Cast Injection: $(p : \alpha) = (q : \alpha) \leftrightarrow p = q$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Rat.Cast.CharZero
Name: Rat.cast_inj
Description: For any rational numbers $p$ and $q$, and for any field (or division ring) $\alpha$ of characteristic zero, the canonical map from $\mathbb{Q}$ to $\alpha$ satisfies $(p : \alpha) = (q : \alpha)$ if and only if $p = q$.
Signature:  : (p : α) = q ↔ p = q
