Module: Mathlib.Analysis.SumIntegralComparisons
Name: integral_le_sum_mul_Ico_of_antitone_monotone
Description: Let $a, b \in \mathbb{R}$ with $a \leq b$, and let $f \colon \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$ and $g \colon \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$ be functions. Suppose that:
1. $f$ is antitone on the interval $[a, b]$,
