Description: The delaborator for the `Finset.sum` notation, which controls how summation expressions are pretty-printed. When the sum is over `Finset.univ`, it optionally shows the domain type based on the pretty-printing setting `pp.piBinderTypes`. The notation can appear in either of two forms:
