Module: Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Integral.IntervalIntegral
Name: MeasureTheory.IntegrableOn.intervalIntegrable
Description: If a function $f : \mathbb{R} \to E$ is integrable on the closed interval $[a, b]$ with respect to a measure $\mu$, then $f$ is interval integrable on $[a, b]$ with respect to $\mu$, i.e., $f$ is integrable on both $(a, b]$ and $(b, a]$.
