1. [THEOREM] Positivity of Square Root: $\sqrt{x} > 0 \leftrightarrow x > 0$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Real.Sqrt
Name: Real.sqrt_pos
Description: For any real number $x$, the square root of $x$ is positive if and only if $x$ is positive, i.e., $\sqrt{x} > 0 \leftrightarrow x > 0$.
Signature:  : 0 < √x ↔ 0 < x

2. [THEOREM] Interval integrability of $x^r$ for $r > -1$ with Lebesgue measure
