Module: Mathlib.Topology.Order.NhdsSet
Name: Icc_mem_nhdsSet_Ioc
Description: For any elements $a, b, c, d$ in a linearly ordered type $\alpha$, if $a \leq b$ and $c < d$, then the closed interval $[a, d]$ belongs to the neighborhood filter of the left-open right-closed interval $(b, c]$.
