Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Finset.Basic
Name: Finset.mem_uIcc_of_ge
Description: For any elements $a, b, x$ in a lattice $\alpha$, if $b \leq x$ and $x \leq a$, then $x$ belongs to the unordered closed interval $\text{uIcc}(a, b) = \{x \in \alpha \mid a \sqcap b \leq x \leq a \sqcup b\}$.
