Description: The restriction operation on vector measures, viewed as a linear map. For a fixed subset \( i \subseteq \alpha \), the map sends a vector measure \( v \) to its restriction \( v \restrict i \), which is linear in \( v \). That is, for any vector measures \( v, w \) and scalar \( c \), we have:
