Signature:  : Antitone f ↔ ∀ ⦃a b⦄, a < b → f b ≤ f a

4. [THEOREM] Characterization of Singleton Closed Intervals: $[a,b] = \{c\} \leftrightarrow a = c = b$
Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Basic
Name: Set.Icc_eq_singleton_iff
