Module: Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Function.L1Space.Integrable
Name: MeasureTheory.integrable_const_mul_iff
Description: Let $\mathbb{k}$ be a normed ring, $f \colon \alpha \to \mathbb{k}$ a function, and $\mu$ a measure on $\alpha$. For any unit element $c \in \mathbb{k}$, the following are equivalent:
