2. [THEOREM] Composition of Restrictions for Nested Subsets
Module: Mathlib.Data.Set.Function
Name: Set.restrict₂_comp_restrict
Description: For any sets $s$ and $t$ of elements of type $\alpha$ with $s \subseteq t$, the composition of the restriction of a function from $t$ to $s$ with the restriction of a function from $\alpha$ to $t$ is equal to the restriction of the function from $\alpha$ to $s$. In other words, for any function $f$ defined on $\alpha$, we have:
\[ (\text{restrict}_s^t) \circ (\text{restrict}_t^\alpha) = \text{restrict}_s^\alpha \]
where $\text{restrict}_A^B$ denotes the restriction operation from set $B$ to set $A$.
