Module: Mathlib.Data.Set.Function
Name: Set.restrict₂_comp_restrict₂
Description: For any nested subsets $s \subseteq t \subseteq u$ of a type $\alpha$, the composition of the restriction from $t$ to $s$ with the restriction from $u$ to $t$ is equal to the restriction from $u$ to $s$. That is, for any function $f$ defined on $u$, we have:
\[ (\text{restrict}_s^t) \circ (\text{restrict}_t^u) = \text{restrict}_s^u \]
where $\text{restrict}_A^B$ denotes the restriction of a function from set $B$ to set $A$.
