5. [THEOREM] Definition of Closed Interval via Set Comprehension
Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Defs
Name: Set.Icc_def
Description: For any elements $a$ and $b$ in a preorder $\alpha$, the set $\{x \mid a \leq x \leq b\}$ is equal to the closed interval $[a, b]$.
