1. [THEOREM] Inequality of Ratios under Monotonicity Conditions
Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic
Name: div_le_div
Description: Let $\alpha$ be a linearly ordered semifield. For any elements $a, b, c, d \in \alpha$ such that:
1. $0 \leq c$,
2. $a \leq c$,
3. $0 < d$,
4. $d \leq b$,

it follows that $\frac{a}{b} \leq \frac{c}{d}$.
Signature:  (hc : 0 ≤ c) (hac : a ≤ c) (hd : 0 < d) (hbd : d ≤ b) : a / b ≤ c / d

2. [THEOREM] Inequality for Positive Fractions: $\frac{a}{b} \leq \frac{a}{c} \leftrightarrow c \leq b$ when $a, b, c > 0$
Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Order.GroupWithZero.Unbundled
Name: div_le_div_iff_of_pos_left
Description: For any positive real numbers $a, b, c$, the inequality $\frac{a}{b} \leq \frac{a}{c}$ holds if and only if $c \leq b$.
Signature:  (ha : 0 < a) (hb : 0 < b) (hc : 0 < c) : a / b ≤ a / c ↔ c ≤ b

3. [THEOREM] Inequality for Ratios with Partial Order Conditions: $\frac{a}{b} < \frac{c}{d}$ under $a \leq c$, $d < b$, and positivity constraints
Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic
Name: div_lt_div'
Description: Let $\alpha$ be a linearly ordered semifield. For any elements $a, b, c, d \in \alpha$ such that:
1. $a \leq c$,
2. $d < b$,
3. $0 < c$,
4. $0 < d$,

it follows that $\frac{a}{b} < \frac{c}{d}$.
Signature:  (hac : a ≤ c) (hbd : d < b) (c0 : 0 < c) (d0 : 0 < d) : a / b < c / d

4. [THEOREM] Restriction Measure Formula for Measurable Sets: $\mu|_s(t) = \mu(t \cap s)$
Module: Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Measure.Restrict
Name: MeasureTheory.Measure.restrict_apply
Description: For any measurable set $t$ in a measurable space $\alpha$, the measure of $t$ with respect to the restriction $\mu|_s$ of a measure $\mu$ to a subset $s \subseteq \alpha$ is equal to the measure of $t \cap s$ under $\mu$, i.e.,
\[ \mu|_s(t) = \mu(t \cap s). \]
Signature:  (ht : MeasurableSet t) : μ.restrict s t = μ (t ∩ s)
