1. [THEOREM] Square Root Inequality: $\sqrt{x} \leq y \leftrightarrow x \leq y^2$ for $y \geq 0$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Real.Sqrt
Name: Real.sqrt_le_left
Description: For any real numbers $x$ and $y$ with $y \geq 0$, the inequality $\sqrt{x} \leq y$ holds if and only if $x \leq y^2$.
Signature:  (hy : 0 ≤ y) : √x ≤ y ↔ x ≤ y ^ 2

2. [THEOREM] Square Root Order Preservation for Positive Arguments: $\sqrt{x} \leq \sqrt{y} \leftrightarrow x \leq y$ when $x > 0$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Real.Sqrt
Name: Real.sqrt_le_sqrt_iff'
Description: For any real numbers $x$ and $y$ with $x > 0$, the inequality $\sqrt{x} \leq \sqrt{y}$ holds if and only if $x \leq y$.
Signature:  (hx : 0 < x) : √x ≤ √y ↔ x ≤ y

3. [THEOREM] Square Root Order Preservation: $\sqrt{x} \leq \sqrt{y} \leftrightarrow x \leq y$ for $y \geq 0$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Real.Sqrt
Name: Real.sqrt_le_sqrt_iff
Description: For any real numbers $x$ and $y$ with $y \geq 0$, the inequality $\sqrt{x} \leq \sqrt{y}$ holds if and only if $x \leq y$.
Signature:  (hy : 0 ≤ y) : √x ≤ √y ↔ x ≤ y

