Module: Mathlib.Data.Real.Sqrt
Name: Real.le_sqrt_of_sq_le
Description: For any real numbers $x$ and $y$, if $x^2 \leq y$, then $x \leq \sqrt{y}$.
Signature:  (h : x ^ 2 ≤ y) : x ≤ √y

5. [THEOREM] Square Root Preserves Order: $\sqrt{x} \leq \sqrt{y}$ when $x \leq y$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Real.Sqrt
Name: Real.sqrt_le_sqrt
Description: For any real numbers $x$ and $y$ such that $x \leq y$, the square root of $x$ is less than or equal to the square root of $y$, i.e., $\sqrt{x} \leq \sqrt{y}$.
Signature:  (h : x ≤ y) : √x ≤ √y

