Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.ProjIcc
Name: Set.IccExtend_apply
Description: For any linearly ordered type $\alpha$ and elements $a, b \in \alpha$ with $a \leq b$, the extension $\mathrm{IccExtend}(h, f)$ of a function $f \colon [a, b] \to \beta$ satisfies
